OL,5,G0630 Breakfast
OL,6,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,7,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,8,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,9,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,10,     FTom Service talks to the
OL,11,     Ftrailblazing American conductor
OL,12,     FMarin Alsop about her musical life
OL,13,     Fand why she's still up for the
OL,14,     Ffight for equality, plus a deep
OL,15,     Fdive into the Ocarina.
OL,16,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,17,     FJools is joined by the composer
OL,18,     FDebbie Wiseman, with music by
OL,19,     FMessiaen, Chopin and Horovitz.
