OL,11,     FBaritone Bernard Richter and
OL,12,     Fsoprano Sara Blanch star in
OL,13,     FDebussy's Pelleas et Melisande
OL,14,     Fwith the chorus and opera of La
OL,15,     FScala, Milan and conductor Maxime
OL,16,     FPascal.
